      "title": "KoiPhish - The Beautiful Phishing Proxy",
      "summary": "KoiPhish is a simple yet beautiful relay proxy idea. The idea for this little project goes back many years. Since I started learning Golang I figured it would be good exercise to finally go ahead an implement it. So, last December during the 35C3 (which is always inspiring congress) I wrote it up. It relays requests a client makes to the KoiPish to the actual target and responses are sent back to the client. On the way in and out common links are overwritten in order to not break the user experience and functionality.",
